OL,3,GNEWSACoercive control victim unaware of
OL,4,Acrime until boyfriend's arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FShannon Byrne did not realise she had
OL,7,Fbeen the victim of a crime until her
OL,8,Fboyfriend was arrested and taken into
OL,9,Fcustody.
OL,11,FThe now 21-year-old was sitting in the
OL,12,Fback of a police car after her family,
OL,13,Fwho were concerned for her safety, had
OL,14,Fraised the alarm.
OL,16,F"[The police officer] went through the
OL,17,FDASH (domestic abuse, stalking and
OL,18,Fhonour-based violence risk checklist)
OL,19,Fquestions with me," said Shannon.
